        {
          "type": "markdown-block",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": ""
            }
          ],
          "content": "| Metric | Paper | Reproduced | Absolute Delta |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| MRR | 0.379100 | 0.377988 | 0.001112 |\n| Hits@1 | 0.350900 | 0.349606 | 0.001294 |\n| Hits@3 | 0.392000 | 0.392978 | 0.000978 |\n| Hits@10 | 0.432000 | 0.427338 | 0.004662 |\n\nVerdict: **STRONG_MATCH**. The run used a Tesla T4 for approximately 6h41m.\nThe completed epoch-2000 checkpoint hash is\n`db2e47779049d569dda58810b9f8b3aa5e0f4da52b2a9c02677ba399510e7785` and the\nevidence artifact is `momok-mkg-y-kaggle-evidence:v0`. The Kaggle process\nreturned an error only after training, while constructing a W&B environment\ntable with mixed string/numeric values; this was repaired without retraining."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Cross-Dataset Comparison",
              "inlineComments": []
            }
          ],
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown-block",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": ""
            }
          ],
          "content": "| Dataset / Metric | Paper | Reproduced | Absolute Delta |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| MKG-W MRR | 0.3589000000 | 0.3514488296 | 0.0074511704 |\n| MKG-W H@1 | 0.3038000000 | 0.2979644361 | 0.0058355639 |\n| MKG-W H@3 | 0.3754000000 | 0.3711979410 | 0.0042020590 |\n| MKG-W H@10 | 0.4613000000 | 0.4532054282 | 0.0080945718 |\n| MKG-Y MRR | 0.3791000000 | 0.3779882618 | 0.0011117382 |\n| MKG-Y H@1 | 0.3509000000 | 0.3496057078 | 0.0012942922 |\n| MKG-Y H@3 | 0.3920000000 | 0.3929778445 | 0.0009778445 |\n| MKG-Y H@10 | 0.4320000000 | 0.4273375892 | 0.0046624108 |\n\nMaximum absolute delta: MKG-W `0.0080945718`; MKG-Y `0.004662`. Both are\n`STRONG_MATCH`. These deltas are a reproducibility comparison, not a claim\nthat one dataset/model run is statistically better than the other."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Ablation Studies — MKG-W",
              "inlineComments": []
            }
          ],
          "level": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown-block",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": ""
            }
          ],
          "content": "These are retrospective imports from completed Kaggle runs. Curves show only\nthe 20 observed evaluations at epochs 100–2000. Final table metrics come from\nthe terminal legacy `Test set results` summary, which tracks best values\nindependently by metric; they are distinct from the epoch-2000 evaluation row.\n\nThe baseline row is the paper's **Full Model (Proposed Method)** run. These\nthree results are one-seed operational ablations under\n`legacy_best_per_metric`. Exact equivalence to the paper's Table 2 protocol is\nnot claimed."
        },
