          "content": "| Variant | Run | Metric | Full Model | Reproduced | Signed Delta | Absolute Delta |\n|---|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| Full Model (Proposed Method) | [`k2evocuw`](https://wandb.ai/trandainien1/graphml-momok-reproduction/runs/k2evocuw) | MRR | 0.3514488296 | 0.3514488296 | 0.0000000000 | 0.0000000000 |\n| Full Model (Proposed Method) | [`k2evocuw`](https://wandb.ai/trandainien1/graphml-momok-reproduction/runs/k2evocuw) | Hits@1 | 0.2979644361 | 0.2979644361 | 0.0000000000 | 0.0000000000 |\n| Full Model (Proposed Method) | [`k2evocuw`](https://wandb.ai/trandainien1/graphml-momok-reproduction/runs/k2evocuw) | Hits@3 | 0.3711979410 | 0.3711979410 | 0.0000000000 | 0.0000000000 |\n| Full Model (Proposed Method) | [`k2evocuw`](https://wandb.ai/trandainien1/graphml-momok-reproduction/runs/k2evocuw) | Hits@10 | 0.4532054282 | 0.4532054282 | 0.0000000000 | 0.0000000000 |\n| `no_gating_noise` | [`mkgwngn1`](https://wandb.ai/trandainien1/graphml-momok-reproduction/runs/mkgwngn1) | MRR | 0.3514488296 | 0.3503000000 | -0.0011488296 | 0.0011488296 |\n| `no_gating_noise` | [`mkgwngn1`](https://wandb.ai/trandainien1/graphml-momok-reproduction/runs/mkgwngn1) | Hits@1 | 0.2979644361 | 0.2983000000 | +0.0003355639 | 0.0003355639 |\n| `no_gating_noise` | [`mkgwngn1`](https://wandb.ai/trandainien1/graphml-momok-reproduction/runs/mkgwngn1) | Hits@3 | 0.3711979410 | 0.3728000000 | +0.0016020590 | 0.0016020590 |\n| `no_gating_noise` | [`mkgwngn1`](https://wandb.ai/trandainien1/graphml-momok-reproduction/runs/mkgwngn1) | Hits@10 | 0.4532054282 | 0.4543000000 | +0.0010945718 | 0.0010945718 |\n| `no_exid` | [`mkgwnex1`](https://wandb.ai/trandainien1/graphml-momok-reproduction/runs/mkgwnex1) | MRR | 0.3514488296 | 0.3509000000 | -0.0005488296 | 0.0005488296 |\n| `no_exid` | [`mkgwnex1`](https://wandb.ai/trandainien1/graphml-momok-reproduction/runs/mkgwnex1) | Hits@1 | 0.2979644361 | 0.2968000000 | -0.0011644361 | 0.0011644361 |\n| `no_exid` | [`mkgwnex1`](https://wandb