          "content": "**Operational variants (one seed, legacy best-per-metric policy):**\n\n| Variant | Definition | Kaggle kernel | Checkpoint SHA256 | Evidence Artifact |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `no_gating_noise` | Gaussian gating noise disabled in the existing MoE gating path; other model settings retained. | [nientrandai/momok-mkg-w-no-gating-noise-full](https://www.kaggle.com/code/nientrandai/momok-mkg-w-no-gating-noise-full) | `58052dd66e83e61a58c1cc9bc5728dcb8285630280c23c77a89bed4e5caa3291` | `momok-mkg-w-no-gating-noise-kaggle-v1-evidence:v0` |\n| `no_exid` | CLUB/ExID estimator and its optimizer disabled; mu=0.0; other model settings retained. | [nientrandai/momok-mkg-w-no-exid-full](https://www.kaggle.com/code/nientrandai/momok-mkg-w-no-exid-full) | `cf2d30c4883b1aec837da0aad6251ba5dd74b4aaf346d04307ad702cbaa81fc0` | `momok-mkg-w-no-exid-kaggle-v1-evidence:v0` |\n| `no_relation_temperature` | Relation-conditioned temperature removed from expert gating; relation embeddings used by prediction heads remain active. | [nientrandai/momok-mkg-w-no-relation-temperature-full](https://www.kaggle.com/code/nientrandai/momok-mkg-w-no-relation-temperature-full) | `6aa771d6c985fec4ae97225a77c1f24ed40631b6e8e493c8f0607755833d6898` | `momok-mkg-w-no-relation-temperature-kaggle-v1-evidence:v0` |\n\nRun: [mkgwngn1](https://wandb.ai/trandainien1/graphml-momok-reproduction/runs/mkgwngn1); 2000/2000 epochs; 20 observed history points; retrospective import.\n\nRun: [mkgwnex1](https://wandb.ai/trandainien1/graphml-momok-reproduction/runs/mkgwnex1); 2000/2000 epochs; 20 observed history points; retrospective import.\n\nRun: [mkgwnrt1](https://wandb.ai/trandainien1/graphml-momok-reproduction/runs/mkgwnrt1); 2000/2000 epochs; 20 observed history points; retrospective import."
